cuems-common (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * CUEMS common configuration and systemd services
  * All Python scripts use /usr/lib/cuems/bin/python3 from cuems-utils
  * Wayland support via cuems-wayland.service
  * WiFi access point support via hostapd and isc-dhcp-server

